OL,3,GNEWSACouncillor quits Greens for Tories
OL,4,Aover racism vote
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Green Party councillor has defected
OL,7,Fto the Conservatives in protest at his
OL,8,Fformer party's decision to declare
OL,9,FZionism a form of racism.
OL,11,FDaniel Potter, who sits on Babergh
OL,12,FDistrict Council in Suffolk, made the
OL,13,Fmove following a Green Party conference
OL,14,Fat the weekend in Brighton.
OL,16,FHe said the vote about Zionism, which
OL,17,Fhad brought condemnation and divided
OL,18,Fthe party, "disturbs me greatly".
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
