OL,3,GNEWSACouncillor quits Greens for Tories
OL,4,Aover racism vote
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leader of the Greens on Babergh
OL,7,FCouncil said she was saddened to hear
OL,8,Fabout Potter's defection, adding that
OL,9,Fthe local party "stands four square
OL,10,Fagainst any form of antisemitism and
OL,11,FIslamophobia"
